<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.01 vs   0.00</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.35 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Sales		    5.27 vs   4.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.89 vs   4.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.63 vs   7.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.91 vs   5.89</p>
<p> Sales		   57.18 vs  50.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
